WEBVTT

00:00:30.595 --> 00:00:32.976
Sayohatimni Kaliforniyadan

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:36.245
UC Berkeleyning eski vinetkalardan
talabalarning suratini ko'zdan

00:00:36.269 --> 00:00:39.976
kechirib, ularning umrlari davomida 
erishgan muvaffaqiyat va sog’lik

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:44.542
darajasini o’lchashga uringan 30 
yillik longityud tadqiqotidan boshladim.

00:00:44.566 --> 00:00:46.614
Talabalarning tabassumini o’lchash orqali

00:00:46.638 --> 00:00:48.423
tadqiqotchilar sinaluvchilarning

00:00:48.447 --> 00:00:52.664
oilaviy turmushi qanchalik muvaffaqiyatli 
va mustahkam bo’lishini

00:00:52.688 --> 00:00:53.750
(Kulgu)

00:00:53.774 --> 00:00:57.695
tibbiy ko’rik natijalarini va atrofdagi
insonlarni qanchalik ilhomlantira

00:00:57.719 --> 00:01:00.000
olishini oldindan aytib bera olardilar.